    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical-scrolling 2D shooting game with three types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid Shot<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/2dc78ae24a3736c8a746fbe31172f972.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling Laser<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/d6dc3e716cdadf823fed3188e7ca303e.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Burst<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/e9d0716fbd7e40d826fe9879925aa57a.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gatling laser hits the target, a gauge is accumulated, and when it is accumulated to the maximum, the level is raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, the number of simultaneous lock-ons increases, the speed of the laser increases, and the power of a laser decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When level 5 or higher is reached, full burst becomes available. <br>Press and hold Y to switch to full burst aiming and lock on up to 16 locks. <br>Release Y or wait a certain amount of time before firing a full burst. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a full burst lowers your level by 1, but increases the multiplier of the score item you get when you destroy an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical-scrolling 2D shooting game with three types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid Shot<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/2dc78ae24a3736c8a746fbe31172f972.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling Laser<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/d6dc3e716cdadf823fed3188e7ca303e.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Burst<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/e9d0716fbd7e40d826fe9879925aa57a.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gatling laser hits the target, a gauge is accumulated, and when it is accumulated to the maximum, the level is raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, the number of simultaneous lock-ons increases, the speed of the laser increases, and the power of a laser decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When level 5 or higher is reached, full burst becomes available. <br>Press and hold Y to switch to full burst aiming and lock on up to 16 locks. <br>Release Y or wait a certain amount of time before firing a full burst. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a full burst lowers your level by 1, but increases the multiplier of the score item you get when you destroy an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
